### Files — Endpoints/FileEndpoints.cs (P4.4). Public, provider-agnostic read
### over whatever IFileStore holds — works unchanged if the LocalDisk
### provider ever swaps for a blob store (see docs/file-storage.md).

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7105

### Get a stored file by id — swap in a real StoredFile.Id (e.g. from a
### Listing's PhotoFileId column, or the response of Listings.http's photo
### upload request).
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Get a file that doesn't exist — expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
